title: "Bayesian Market Making in OCaml"
type: software
abstract: "A reproducible OCaml simulation study of Bayesian market making under adverse selection, including sequential learning, parameter misspecification, joint inference of information intensity, regime change, and a separate quote-sensitive inventory experiment."
authors:
